WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
So, I'll just leave that, thank you so much again

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:09.280
for having this, you know, this is very dangerous.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.460
You know, we don't work for companies

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.560
that have billions of dollars.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:16.040
You know, we're running and gunning often on our own.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.719
A lot, we became friends, a lot of us are friends

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.760
because we wouldn't see each other all the time

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.400
and we became friends because we wanted

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.740
to have someone watch our back while we're out there

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:26.780
because like I said, we're just out there.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.719
And, but we'll continue to do it

00:00:28.719 --> 00:00:30.980
because it's an important topic, it's an important issue.

00:00:31.459 --> 00:00:33.619
The American people deserve to know what's happening

00:00:33.619 --> 00:00:35.220
in these chaotic situations and, you know,

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.060
we're more than happy to do it.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.099
So, thanks, sir.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.040
Great job, thank you very much, very much.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.060
Katie, please.

